OL,3,GNEWSAFootball fan who let off flare
OL,4,Agiven three-year ban
OL,5,
OL,6,FA football fan has been banned from
OL,7,Fattending matches for three years after
OL,8,Fhe let off a flare during a League One
OL,9,Fmatch.
OL,11,FChris Grindrod, 36, from Blackpool,
OL,12,Ftook the flare to the Select Car
OL,13,FLeasing Stadium in Reading on 5
OL,14,FSeptember when the Royals were playing
OL,15,FBlackpool. Reading won 3-1.
OL,17,FGrindrod admitted possessing a flare at
OL,18,Fa sporting event at Reading
OL,19,FMagistrates' Court on 10 November and
OL,20,Fwas fined #369 and ordered to pay #85
OL,21,Fin costs and a #148 victim surcharge.
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
