OL,3,GNEWSAFootball fan who let off flare
OL,4,Agiven three-year ban
OL,5,
OL,6,FPC Steve Mountain, Thames Valley
OL,7,FPolice's dedicated football officer,
OL,8,Fsaid flares and pyrotechnics had "no
OL,9,Fplace inside football stadiums".
